# Terraform
#
# State files record every attribute of every resource, including values AWS
# generates and any secret passed into a resource, in plain text. They are also
# environment-specific. Neither belongs in version control.
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
